<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Christ is the very Word of God,</l><l>He is God’s explanation true;</l><l>God’s full embodiment is He</l><l>And God’s own image brings to view.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Image of God invisible,</l><l>Effulgence of God’s glory fair;</l><l>God’s fulness ever dwells in Him,</l><l>God’s testimony He doth bear.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The Church the myst’ry is of Christ,</l><l>For He is now to man unshown;</l><l>No man on earth may see Him now,</l><l>But thru the Church He is made known.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>The Church is Christ’s expression full,</l><l>In her Christ dwelleth bodily;</l><l>She is His duplication true,</l><l>And man in her Himself may see.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>The Church the image has of Christ,</l><l>She is His increase and His spread;</l><l>Christ’s very self is found in her</l><l>The Body, she, to Christ the Head.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Thus, in the Son the Father is,</l><l>And now the Spirit is the Son;</l><l>The Spirit of the triune God</l><l>Is in the Church and with her one.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
